  << /ActualText (Freelance Full Stack Developer \050Remote\051 \nSept 2021 \055 Present\nDelivered 15\053 client projects across e\055commerce\054 real estate\054 and service industries\054 meeting business and user requirements\nBuilt full\055stack applications using MERN stack with secure Paystack payment integration\054 improving transaction reliability\nDeveloped mobile\055first\054 SEO\055optimized websites that enhanced user engagement and conversion rates\nIntegrated RESTful APIs and third\055party services to extend application functionality\nCollaborated with designers and stakeholders to translate business needs into scalable solutions\nOptimized and maintained existing systems\054 improving load speed and overall performance\nRefactored legacy applications into modern React architectures\054 increasing maintainability by up to 50\045\n\nFrontend Web Development Tutor \055 Kodex Africa \050Awka\051\nSept 2023 \055 Jan 2024\nDelivered structured training in frontend web development\054 covering HTML5\054 CSS3\054 JavaScript\054 and introductory React concepts\056\nMentored and guided 15\053 beginner developers through hands\055on projects\054 improving their practical coding and problem\055solving skills\056\nDesigned and facilitated coding exercises\054 assignments\054 and 4\053 real\055world mini\055projects to reinforce learning outcomes\056\nIntroduced students to modern web development tools\054 workflows\054 and version control using Git\057GitHub\054 Bootstrap\054 TailwindCSS\054 jQuery\054 SASS\054 React\054 and Redux\056\nProvided code reviews and constructive feedback to improve code quality\054 readability\054 and best practices\056\nSupported students in building responsive\054 user\055friendly web interfaces following industry standards\nSimplified complex technical concepts\054 improving student engagement and learning retention\056\n\nContract Web Developer \055 SYNCTECH \050Remote\051\nJun 2022 \055 August 2023\nDeveloped custom websites and landing pages for international clients \050UK\054 Canada\054 Africa\051\056\nBuilt responsive UI components and ensured cross\055browser compatibility\056\nImplemented CMS\055based and custom solutions depending on client needs\056\nDelivered projects within tight timelines in performance\055driven environments\056\n\nFrontend Developer \055 HNG Internship \0503\055month remote internship\051\nJun 2020 \023 Aug 2020\nDeveloped reusable and scalable UI components using React\056js\nBuilt responsive interfaces for an e\055commerce platform\054 ensuring usability across devices\nIntegrated APIs and implemented best practices for performance and cross\055browser compatibility\nCollaborated with frontend and backend teams to deliver production\055ready features)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 1281 0 R
     /Pg 1252 0 R
     /S /Span
